### Stream text generation with streamText and iterate over textStream

Source: https://ai-sdk.dev/docs/ai-sdk-core/generating-text

Use streamText to stream text responses from an LLM and consume chunks via result.textStream as an async iterable. streamText utilizes backpressure and only generates tokens as they are consumed.

```ts
import { streamText } from 'ai';

const result = streamText({
  model: "anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5",
  prompt: 'Invent a new holiday and describe its traditions.',
});

// example: use textStream as an async iterable
for await (const textPart of result.textStream) {
  console.log(textPart);
}
```

